New Notification'=>'Opret ny meddelelse','Edit Notification'=>'Rediger meddelelse','Search Notifications'=>'Søg i meddelelser','No notification found'=>'Ingen meddelelse fundet','PublishPress Planner tried to load multiple times. Please, deactivate and remove other instances of PublishPress, specially if you are using PublishPress Pro.'=>'PublishPress Planner har forsøgt at indlæse flere gange. Deaktiver og fjern venligst andre forekomster af PublishPress, især hvis du bruger PublishPress Pro.','Warning'=>'Advarsel','%1$s = start date, %2$s = end date %1$s <div class="input-divider">to</div> %2$s'=>' %1$s <div class="input-divider">til</div> %2$s','taxonomy general nameEditorial Field'=>'Redaktionelt område','taxonomy singular nameEditorial Field'=>'Redaktionelt område']];